OL,3,GNEWSAFamily and Army mourn soldier who
OL,4,Adied in river
OL,5,
OL,6,FHundreds of people gathered for the
OL,7,Ffuneral of a soldier who died in the
OL,8,FRiver Tyne after a night out.
OL,10,FLiam Potts, 22, who served with the
OL,11,FColdstream Guards, was found dead close
OL,12,Fto Wylam Bridge on 18 August.
OL,14,FHis funeral service took place at
OL,15,FHexham Abbey and he was given a guard
OL,16,Fof honour by the association of
OL,17,FColdstream Guards before a private
OL,18,Fburial attended by invited family and
OL,19,Ffriends.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
