OL,3,GNEWSAFamily and Army mourn soldier who
OL,4,Adied in river
OL,5,
OL,6,FPaul Potts, Liam's father, said there
OL,7,Fwere "lots of wonderful things being
OL,8,Fsaid about our son, which has genuinely
OL,9,Ftouched our hearts".
